{"id":"n24626-1-7","stage":2,"title":"졸음 · 困意","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24626-1-7-1","ko":"아, 졸음을 쫓을 수가 없네.","zh":"啊，怎么也赶不走困意啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아,","meaning":"咦","explanation":"아：咦","readings":[{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16247","senseId":"1","lemma":"아","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}},{"text":"졸음을","meaning":"困意，睡意","explanation":"졸음：困意，睡意；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"졸음","audio":"/audio/6cd67daad4601281ec43.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24626","senseId":"1","lemma":"졸음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"졸음을","audio":"/audio/fd3ebd279dabf389e7e4.mp3"}},{"text":"쫓을","meaning":"驱赶","explanation":"쫓다：驱赶；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"쫓다","audio":"/audio/e035a6f89994bd9e0b96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37198","senseId":"3","lemma":"쫓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쫓을","audio":"/audio/b9d3b51c6f02b0e1a198.mp3"}},{"text":"수가","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수가","audio":"/audio/6780a417c9a853af476b.mp3"}},{"text":"없네.","meaning":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","explanation":"없다：不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없네","audio":"/audio/40299a69ec2e93a5e2b3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d6ce479be9ddc9b7","term":"아","zh":"咦","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3","entryId":"16247","definition":"感到惊讶、慌张、焦急、急促时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["아"]},{"id":"6cd67daad4601281","term":"졸음","zh":"困意，睡意","audio":"/audio/6cd67daad4601281ec43.mp3","entryId":"24626","definition":"想睡觉的感觉或状态。","pronunciation":["조ː름"]},{"id":"e035a6f89994bd9e","term":"쫓다","zh":"驱赶","audio":"/audio/e035a6f89994bd9e0b96.mp3","entryId":"37198","definition":"赶走困意或杂念等。","pronunciation":["쫃따"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不能（-ㄹ/을 수 없다）","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/001a26a30bbb26193342.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24626-1-7-2","ko":"그럼 가서 찬물로 세수라도 하고 와.","zh":"那去用冷水洗把脸吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"가서","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가서","audio":"/audio/0a4296790d3f4b0e6e6b.mp3"}},{"text":"찬물로","meaning":"冷水，冰水","explanation":"찬물：冷水，冰水；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"찬물","audio":"/audio/658c6529afb87c66be35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71464","senseId":"1","lemma":"찬물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찬물로","audio":"/audio/7b766c0cec6eb25a7f5e.mp3"}},{"text":"세수라도","meaning":"洗脸","explanation":"세수：洗脸；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라도：表示让步或假定：“即使是、就算是”。","readings":[{"term":"세수","audio":"/audio/c24f9137a367703c47b2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63547","senseId":"1","lemma":"세수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"세수라도","audio":"/audio/f09fe81981fcc3a74c19.mp3"}},{"text":"하고","meaning":"做（세수를 하다：洗脸）","explanation":"하다：做（세수를 하다：洗脸）；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하고","audio":"/audio/1a7140c02481d065b267.mp3"}},{"text":"와.","meaning":"感到，袭来","explanation":"오다：感到，袭来；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"18","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"와","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"658c6529afb87c66","term":"찬물","zh":"冷水，冰水","audio":"/audio/658c6529afb87c66be35.mp3","entryId":"71464","definition":"冰冷的水。","pronunciation":["찬물"]},{"id":"c24f9137a367703c","term":"세수","zh":"洗脸","audio":"/audio/c24f9137a367703c47b2.mp3","entryId":"63547","definition":"用水清洗手或脸。","pronunciation":["세ː수"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做（세수를 하다：洗脸）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"做（세수를 하다：洗脸）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"感到，袭来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"出现或产生疾病或困意等。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1c63d305028ef606c247.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.715,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=24626","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.